    // __fern_i32_to_string — STACK-arg ABI for the IR path (the i32 value sits
    // at 8(%rsp), below the call's return address). Loads it into %rdi, then runs
    // asm.fern's register-ABI body verbatim (%rdi in → 16-byte string box in
    // %rax). Allocates a 32-byte scratch buffer, writes decimal digits MSB-first
